(Let's design sequence:)
(We have one task profile.)
(We'll do:)
(- Create origin, allocate vehicle, attach task profile, confirm preparedness, assign operator, activate origin node, lock origin availability. (Now origin task profile linked.))
(- Detach origin task profile (make available).)
(- Create destination, allocate vehicle, attach task profile, confirm preparedness, assign operator, activate destination node, lock destination availability. (Now destination task profile linked.))
