(- Now both origin and destination are locked and confirmed, nodes ready, but we have no task profile linked to either. However we need origin task profile linked for authorize_transport_leg_loading and allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate origin. We also need destination task profile linked for allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate destination.)
