(- Execute origin dispatch.)
(- Detach origin task profile.)
(- Attach destination task profile.)
(- Mark destination dispatch ready (does not need task profile linked, but we have it linked anyway).)
(- Allocate dispatch slot for destination (requires destination task profile linked).)
(- Execute destination dispatch.)
(- Detach destination task profile.)
(Thus we need to manage attachments accordingly.)
